[{"id":"akhraja-87-4-1","words":["verb:akhraja"],"options":[{"bs":"izveo je","en":"brought out"},{"bs":"izgone","en":"they drive out"},{"bs":"i izgonite","en":"and you (all) drive out"},{"bs":"i izveli smo","en":"and we brought out"}],"ref":"87:4","answerWord":"أَخْرَجَ","answerSound":"audio/f959a9dbf806f0b06802.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Who bringeth forth the pasturage,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izvesti, izvaditi","en":"to bring out, to expel"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِىٓ","أَخْرَجَ","ٱلْمَرْعَىٰ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْرَجَ"}},{"id":"akhraja-6-95-5","words":["verb:akhraja"],"options":[{"bs":"izvodi","en":"he/it brings out"},{"bs":"da izvedemo","en":"so that We bring out"},{"bs":"izvodi vas","en":"he/it brings you (all) out"},{"bs":"protjerani smo","en":"we were driven out"}],"ref":"6:95","answerWord":"يُخْرِجُ","answerSound":"audio/5379c6f3ee16ff1aef88.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! Allah (it is) Who splitteth the grain of corn and the date-stone (for sprouting). He bringeth forth the living from the dead, and is the bringer-forth of the dead from the living. Such is Allah. How then are ye perverted?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izvesti, izvaditi","en":"to bring out, to expel"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","فَالِقُ","ٱلْحَبِّ","وَٱلنَّوَىٰ","يُخْرِجُ","ٱلْحَىَّ","مِنَ","ٱلْمَيِّتِ","وَمُخْرِجُ","ٱلْمَيِّتِ","مِنَ","ٱلْحَىِّ","ذَٰلِكُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","فَأَنَّىٰ","تُؤْفَكُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْرَجَ"}},{"id":"akhraja-2-22-11","words":["verb:akhraja"],"options":[{"bs":"pa je izveo","en":"so he/it brought out"},{"bs":"izvedi!","en":"bring out!"},{"bs":"i izvedi me!","en":"and bring me out!"},{"bs":"izgone te","en":"they drive you out"}],"ref":"2:22","answerWord":"فَأَخْرَجَ","answerSound":"audio/39537d1913e0ddccda46.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Who hath appointed the earth a resting-place for you, and the sky a canopy; and causeth water to pour down from the sky, thereby producing fruits as food for you. And do not set up rivals to Allah when ye know (better).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izvesti, izvaditi","en":"to bring out, to expel"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِى","جَعَلَ","لَكُمُ","ٱلْأَرْضَ","فِرَٰشًا","وَٱلسَّمَآءَ","بِنَآءً","وَأَنزَلَ","مِنَ","ٱلسَّمَآءِ","مَآءً","فَأَخْرَجَ","بِهِۦ","مِنَ","ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ","رِزْقًا","لَّكُمْ","فَلَا","تَجْعَلُوا۟","لِلَّهِ","أَندَادًا","وَأَنتُمْ","تَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْرَجَ"}},{"id":"akhraja-23-107-1","words":["verb:akhraja"],"options":[{"bs":"izvedi nas!","en":"bring us out!"},{"bs":"izvodi vas","en":"he/it brings you (all) out"},{"bs":"izveli smo","en":"we brought out"},{"bs":"da istjerate","en":"so that you (all) may drive out"}],"ref":"23:107","answerWord":"أَخْرِجْنَا","answerSound":"audio/fc57a539c919c4652c98.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Our Lord! Oh, bring us forth from hence! If we return (to evil) then indeed we shall be wrong-doers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izvesti, izvaditi","en":"to bring out, to expel"},"passage":["رَبَّنَآ","أَخْرِجْنَا","مِنْهَا","فَإِنْ","عُدْنَا","فَإِنَّا","ظَٰلِمُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْرَجَ"}},{"id":"akhraja-7-25-6","words":["verb:akhraja"],"options":[{"bs":"bivate izvedeni","en":"you (all) are brought out"},{"bs":"protjerani smo","en":"we were driven out"},{"bs":"izgone vas","en":"they drive you (all) out"},{"bs":"bivam izveden","en":"I am brought out"}],"ref":"7:25","answerWord":"تُخْرَجُونَ","answerSound":"audio/42fbcbd4d3208da30a9a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: There shall ye live, and there shall ye die, and thence shall ye be brought forth.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izvesti, izvaditi","en":"to bring out, to expel"},"passage":["قَالَ","فِيهَا","تَحْيَوْنَ","وَفِيهَا","تَمُوتُونَ","وَمِنْهَا","تُخْرَجُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْرَجَ"}},{"id":"akhraja-2-267-9","words":["verb:akhraja"],"options":[{"bs":"izveli smo","en":"we brought out"},{"bs":"izvedi nas!","en":"bring us out!"},{"bs":"i izvodi","en":"and he/it brings out"},{"bs":"izvodimo vas","en":"we bring you (all) out"}],"ref":"2:267","answerWord":"أَخْرَجْنَا","answerSound":"audio/f96c10b5cbece406615f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! Spend of the good things which ye have earned, and of that which We bring forth from the earth for you, and seek not the bad (with intent) to spend thereof (in charity) when ye would not take it for yourselves save with disdain; and know that Allah is Absolute, Owner of Praise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izvesti, izvaditi","en":"to bring out, to expel"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","أَنفِقُوا۟","مِن","طَيِّبَٰتِ","مَا","كَسَبْتُمْ","وَمِمَّآ","أَخْرَجْنَا","لَكُم","مِّنَ","ٱلْأَرْضِ","وَلَا","تَيَمَّمُوا۟","ٱلْخَبِيثَ","مِنْهُ","تُنفِقُونَ","وَلَسْتُم","بِـَٔاخِذِيهِ","إِلَّآ","أَن","تُغْمِضُوا۟","فِيهِ","وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟","أَنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","غَنِىٌّ","حَمِيدٌ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْرَجَ"}},{"id":"akhraja-7-110-2","words":["verb:akhraja"],"options":[{"bs":"izgoni vas","en":"he/it drives you (all) out"},{"bs":"izvodimo","en":"we bring out"},{"bs":"pa ih je istjerao","en":"so he/it expelled them (two)"},{"bs":"da te istjeraju","en":"so that they may drive you out"}],"ref":"7:110","answerWord":"يُخْرِجَكُم","answerSound":"audio/06f8d50ee07d9512baad.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Who would expel you from your land. Now what do ye advise?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izvesti, izvaditi","en":"to bring out, to expel"},"passage":["يُرِيدُ","أَن","يُخْرِجَكُم","مِّنْ","أَرْضِكُمْ","فَمَاذَا","تَأْمُرُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْرَجَ"}},{"id":"akhraja-10-31-15","words":["verb:akhraja"],"options":[{"bs":"i izvodi","en":"and he/it brings out"},{"bs":"izveo me je","en":"he/it brought me out"},{"bs":"i izvodi ih","en":"and he/it brings them out"},{"bs":"izgone","en":"they drive out"}],"ref":"10:31","answerWord":"وَيُخْرِجُ","answerSound":"audio/8704f7431a3a0c66d81f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say (unto them, O Muhammad): Who provideth for you from the sky and the earth, or Who owneth hearing and sight; and Who bringeth forth the living from the dead and bringeth forth the dead from the living; and Who directeth the course? They will say: Allah. Then say: Will ye not then keep your duty (unto Him)?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izvesti, izvaditi","en":"to bring out, to expel"},"passage":["قُلْ","مَن","يَرْزُقُكُم","مِّنَ","ٱلسَّمَآءِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","أَمَّن","يَمْلِكُ","ٱلسَّمْعَ","وَٱلْأَبْصَٰرَ","وَمَن","يُخْرِجُ","ٱلْحَىَّ","مِنَ","ٱلْمَيِّتِ","وَيُخْرِجُ","ٱلْمَيِّتَ","مِنَ","ٱلْحَىِّ","وَمَن","يُدَبِّرُ","ٱلْأَمْرَ","فَسَيَقُولُونَ","ٱللَّهُ","فَقُلْ","أَفَلَا","تَتَّقُونَ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْرَجَ"}},{"id":"akhraja-20-55-5","words":["verb:akhraja"],"options":[{"bs":"izvodimo vas","en":"we bring you (all) out"},{"bs":"izveo te je","en":"he/it brought you out"},{"bs":"izgonite ih","en":"you (all) expel them"},{"bs":"izvodimo","en":"we bring out"}],"ref":"20:55","answerWord":"نُخْرِجُكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/173319a92262b7ef03b9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thereof We created you, and thereunto We return you, and thence We bring you forth a second time.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izvesti, izvaditi","en":"to bring out, to expel"},"passage":["مِنْهَا","خَلَقْنَٰكُمْ","وَفِيهَا","نُعِيدُكُمْ","وَمِنْهَا","نُخْرِجُكُمْ","تَارَةً","أُخْرَىٰ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْرَجَ"}},{"id":"akhraja-2-36-3","words":["verb:akhraja"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ih je istjerao","en":"so he/it expelled them (two)"},{"bs":"i izveo je","en":"and he/it brought out"},{"bs":"istjerali su vas","en":"they drove you (all) out"},{"bs":"izvedi nas!","en":"bring us out!"}],"ref":"2:36","answerWord":"فَأَخْرَجَهُمَا","answerSound":"audio/078197fae2f4fdaf478b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But Satan caused them to deflect therefrom and expelled them from the (happy) state in which they were; and We said: Fall down, one of you a foe unto the other! There shall be for you on earth a habitation and provision for a time.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izvesti, izvaditi","en":"to bring out, to expel"},"passage":["فَأَزَلَّهُمَا","ٱلشَّيْطَٰنُ","عَنْهَا","فَأَخْرَجَهُمَا","مِمَّا","كَانَا","فِيهِ","وَقُلْنَا","ٱهْبِطُوا۟","بَعْضُكُمْ","لِبَعْضٍ","عَدُوٌّ","وَلَكُمْ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","مُسْتَقَرٌّ","وَمَتَٰعٌ","إِلَىٰ","حِينٍ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْرَجَ"}},{"id":"akhraja-2-84-7","words":["verb:akhraja"],"options":[{"bs":"izgonite","en":"you (all) drive out"},{"bs":"izvodimo vas","en":"we bring you (all) out"},{"bs":"izveo me je","en":"he/it brought me out"},{"bs":"i izvodi","en":"and he/it brings out"}],"ref":"2:84","answerWord":"تُخْرِجُونَ","answerSound":"audio/f29bc6dce04abe85a470.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when We made with you a covenant (saying): Shed not the blood of your people nor turn (a party of) your people out of your dwellings. Then ye ratified (Our covenant) and ye were witnesses (thereto).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izvesti, izvaditi","en":"to bring out, to expel"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","أَخَذْنَا","مِيثَٰقَكُمْ","لَا","تَسْفِكُونَ","دِمَآءَكُمْ","وَلَا","تُخْرِجُونَ","أَنفُسَكُم","مِّن","دِيَٰرِكُمْ","ثُمَّ","أَقْرَرْتُمْ","وَأَنتُمْ","تَشْهَدُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْرَجَ"}},{"id":"akhraja-2-191-3","words":["verb:akhraja"],"options":[{"bs":"i istjerajte ih!","en":"and (you all) drive them out!"},{"bs":"izveo vas je","en":"he/it brought you (all) out"},{"bs":"i izveo je","en":"and he/it brought out"},{"bs":"izvode ih","en":"they bring them out"}],"ref":"2:191","answerWord":"وَأَخْرِجُوهُم","answerSound":"audio/92baa2888521d6361622.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And slay them wherever ye find them, and drive them out of the places whence they drove you out, for persecution is worse than slaughter. And fight not with them at the Inviolable Place of Worship until they first attack you there, but if they attack you (there) then slay them. Such is the reward of disbelievers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izvesti, izvaditi","en":"to bring out, to expel"},"passage":["وَٱقْتُلُوهُمْ","حَيْثُ","ثَقِفْتُمُوهُمْ","وَأَخْرِجُوهُم","مِّنْ","حَيْثُ","أَخْرَجُوكُمْ","وَٱلْفِتْنَةُ","أَشَدُّ","مِنَ","ٱلْقَتْلِ","وَلَا","تُقَٰتِلُوهُمْ","عِندَ","ٱلْمَسْجِدِ","ٱلْحَرَامِ","حَتَّىٰ","يُقَٰتِلُوكُمْ","فِيهِ","فَإِن","قَٰتَلُوكُمْ","فَٱقْتُلُوهُمْ","كَذَٰلِكَ","جَزَآءُ","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْرَجَ"}},{"id":"akhraja-2-191-6","words":["verb:akhraja"],"options":[{"bs":"istjerali su vas","en":"they drove you (all) out"},{"bs":"izveo me je","en":"he/it brought me out"},{"bs":"protjerani ste","en":"you (all) were driven out"},{"bs":"zaista će istjerati","en":"surely he/it will drive out"}],"ref":"2:191","answerWord":"أَخْرَجُوكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/0c3dada7c1c5b92ae3af.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And slay them wherever ye find them, and drive them out of the places whence they drove you out, for persecution is worse than slaughter. And fight not with them at the Inviolable Place of Worship until they first attack you there, but if they attack you (there) then slay them. Such is the reward of disbelievers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izvesti, izvaditi","en":"to bring out, to expel"},"passage":["وَٱقْتُلُوهُمْ","حَيْثُ","ثَقِفْتُمُوهُمْ","وَأَخْرِجُوهُم","مِّنْ","حَيْثُ","أَخْرَجُوكُمْ","وَٱلْفِتْنَةُ","أَشَدُّ","مِنَ","ٱلْقَتْلِ","وَلَا","تُقَٰتِلُوهُمْ","عِندَ","ٱلْمَسْجِدِ","ٱلْحَرَامِ","حَتَّىٰ","يُقَٰتِلُوكُمْ","فِيهِ","فَإِن","قَٰتَلُوكُمْ","فَٱقْتُلُوهُمْ","كَذَٰلِكَ","جَزَآءُ","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْرَجَ"}},{"id":"akhraja-2-257-4","words":["verb:akhraja"],"options":[{"bs":"izvodi ih","en":"he/it brings them out"},{"bs":"i izvela je","en":"and she/it brought out"},{"bs":"izvodimo","en":"we bring out"},{"bs":"izgoni vas","en":"he/it drives you (all) out"}],"ref":"2:257","answerWord":"يُخْرِجُهُم","answerSound":"audio/fdb54411232097014273.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah is the Protecting Guardian of those who believe. He bringeth them out of darkness into light. As for those who disbelieve, their patrons are false deities. They bring them out of light into darkness. Such are rightful owners of the Fire. They will abide therein.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izvesti, izvaditi","en":"to bring out, to expel"},"passage":["ٱللَّهُ","وَلِىُّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","يُخْرِجُهُم","مِّنَ","ٱلظُّلُمَٰتِ","إِلَى","ٱلنُّورِ","وَٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوٓا۟","أَوْلِيَآؤُهُمُ","ٱلطَّٰغُوتُ","يُخْرِجُونَهُم","مِّنَ","ٱلنُّورِ","إِلَى","ٱلظُّلُمَٰتِ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","أَصْحَٰبُ","ٱلنَّارِ","هُمْ","فِيهَا","خَٰلِدُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْرَجَ"}},{"id":"akhraja-2-257-13","words":["verb:akhraja"],"options":[{"bs":"izvode ih","en":"they bring them out"},{"bs":"da istjerate","en":"so that you (all) may drive out"},{"bs":"izveo te je","en":"he/it brought you out"},{"bs":"bivam izveden","en":"I am brought out"}],"ref":"2:257","answerWord":"يُخْرِجُونَهُم","answerSound":"audio/4310ce910e5057e2cb49.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah is the Protecting Guardian of those who believe. He bringeth them out of darkness into light. As for those who disbelieve, their patrons are false deities. They bring them out of light into darkness. Such are rightful owners of the Fire. They will abide therein.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izvesti, izvaditi","en":"to bring out, to expel"},"passage":["ٱللَّهُ","وَلِىُّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","يُخْرِجُهُم","مِّنَ","ٱلظُّلُمَٰتِ","إِلَى","ٱلنُّورِ","وَٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوٓا۟","أَوْلِيَآؤُهُمُ","ٱلطَّٰغُوتُ","يُخْرِجُونَهُم","مِّنَ","ٱلنُّورِ","إِلَى","ٱلظُّلُمَٰتِ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","أَصْحَٰبُ","ٱلنَّارِ","هُمْ","فِيهَا","خَٰلِدُونَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْرَجَ"}},{"id":"akhraja-3-110-3","words":["verb:akhraja"],"options":[{"bs":"izvedena je","en":"she/it was brought out"},{"bs":"pa izvodimo","en":"so we bring out"},{"bs":"zaista ćemo te istjerati","en":"surely we will drive you out"},{"bs":"izvodi","en":"he/it brings out"}],"ref":"3:110","answerWord":"أُخْرِجَتْ","answerSound":"audio/2ca527577ce19c4eef91.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Ye are the best community that hath been raised up for mankind. Ye enjoin right conduct and forbid indecency; and ye believe in Allah. And if the People of the Scripture had believed it had been better for them. Some of them are believers; but most of them are evil-livers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izvesti, izvaditi","en":"to bring out, to expel"},"passage":["كُنتُمْ","خَيْرَ","أُمَّةٍ","أُخْرِجَتْ","لِلنَّاسِ","تَأْمُرُونَ","بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ","وَتَنْهَوْنَ","عَنِ","ٱلْمُنكَرِ","وَتُؤْمِنُونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَلَوْ","ءَامَنَ","أَهْلُ","ٱلْكِتَٰبِ","لَكَانَ","خَيْرًا","لَّهُم","مِّنْهُمُ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","وَأَكْثَرُهُمُ","ٱلْفَٰسِقُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْرَجَ"}},{"id":"akhraja-5-16-8","words":["verb:akhraja"],"options":[{"bs":"i izvodi ih","en":"and he/it brings them out"},{"bs":"da izvedemo","en":"so that We bring out"},{"bs":"i izveli smo","en":"and we brought out"},{"bs":"izvodi","en":"he/it brings out"}],"ref":"5:16","answerWord":"وَيُخْرِجُهُم","answerSound":"audio/95eb0c8c223481746d16.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Whereby Allah guideth him who seeketh His good pleasure unto paths of peace. He bringeth them out of darkness unto light by His decree, and guideth them unto a straight path.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izvesti, izvaditi","en":"to bring out, to expel"},"passage":["يَهْدِى","بِهِ","ٱللَّهُ","مَنِ","ٱتَّبَعَ","رِضْوَٰنَهُۥ","سُبُلَ","ٱلسَّلَٰمِ","وَيُخْرِجُهُم","مِّنَ","ٱلظُّلُمَٰتِ","إِلَى","ٱلنُّورِ","بِإِذْنِهِۦ","وَيَهْدِيهِمْ","إِلَىٰ","صِرَٰطٍ","مُّسْتَقِيمٍ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْرَجَ"}},{"id":"akhraja-7-57-25","words":["verb:akhraja"],"options":[{"bs":"izvodimo","en":"we bring out"},{"bs":"izvedi nas!","en":"bring us out!"},{"bs":"i izveo je","en":"and he/it brought out"},{"bs":"zaista ćemo vas istjerati","en":"surely we will drive you (all) out"}],"ref":"7:57","answerWord":"نُخْرِجُ","answerSound":"audio/63720aef7a54eec75f7d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And He it is Who sendeth the winds as tidings heralding His mercy, till, when they bear a cloud heavy (with rain), We lead it to a dead land, and then cause water to descend thereon and thereby bring forth fruits of every kind. Thus bring We forth the dead. Haply ye may remember.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izvesti, izvaditi","en":"to bring out, to expel"},"passage":["وَهُوَ","ٱلَّذِى","يُرْسِلُ","ٱلرِّيَٰحَ","بُشْرًۢا","بَيْنَ","يَدَىْ","رَحْمَتِهِۦ","حَتَّىٰٓ","إِذَآ","أَقَلَّتْ","سَحَابًا","ثِقَالًا","سُقْنَٰهُ","لِبَلَدٍ","مَّيِّتٍ","فَأَنزَلْنَا","بِهِ","ٱلْمَآءَ","فَأَخْرَجْنَا","بِهِۦ","مِن","كُلِّ","ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ","كَذَٰلِكَ","نُخْرِجُ","ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تَذَكَّرُونَ"],"marked":[25],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْرَجَ"}},{"id":"akhraja-7-82-7","words":["verb:akhraja"],"options":[{"bs":"istjerajte ih!","en":"(you all) drive them out!"},{"bs":"da te istjeraju","en":"so that they may drive you out"},{"bs":"izvodimo","en":"we bring out"},{"bs":"i istjerali su vas","en":"and they drove you (all) out"}],"ref":"7:82","answerWord":"أَخْرِجُوهُم","answerSound":"audio/ee70657b386080f854dc.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And the answer of his people was only that they said (one to another): Turn them out of your township. They are folk, forsooth, who keep pure.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izvesti, izvaditi","en":"to bring out, to expel"},"passage":["وَمَا","كَانَ","جَوَابَ","قَوْمِهِۦٓ","إِلَّآ","أَن","قَالُوٓا۟","أَخْرِجُوهُم","مِّن","قَرْيَتِكُمْ","إِنَّهُمْ","أُنَاسٌ","يَتَطَهَّرُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْرَجَ"}},{"id":"akhraja-7-88-6","words":["verb:akhraja"],"options":[{"bs":"zaista ćemo te istjerati","en":"surely we will drive you out"},{"bs":"i izvedi me!","en":"and bring me out!"},{"bs":"pa ih je istjerao","en":"so he/it expelled them (two)"},{"bs":"da vas izvede","en":"so that he/it may bring you (all) out"}],"ref":"7:88","answerWord":"لَنُخْرِجَنَّكَ","answerSound":"audio/dd859e8d0feef57c357b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The chieftains of his people, who were scornful, said: Surely we will drive thee out, O Shu'eyb, and those who believe with thee, from our township, unless ye return to our religion. He said: Even though we hate it?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izvesti, izvaditi","en":"to bring out, to expel"},"passage":["قَالَ","ٱلْمَلَأُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟","مِن","قَوْمِهِۦ","لَنُخْرِجَنَّكَ","يَٰشُعَيْبُ","وَٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","مَعَكَ","مِن","قَرْيَتِنَآ","أَوْ","لَتَعُودُنَّ","فِى","مِلَّتِنَا","قَالَ","أَوَلَوْ","كُنَّا","كَٰرِهِينَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْرَجَ"}},{"id":"sanaa-5-14-24","words":["verb:sanaa"],"options":[{"bs":"prave","en":"they make"},{"bs":"i pravi","en":"and he/it makes"},{"bs":"napravili su","en":"they made"},{"bs":"napravi!","en":"make!"}],"ref":"5:14","answerWord":"يَصْنَعُونَ","answerSound":"audio/b38aa2ed85c2a673ee1e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And with those who say: \"Lo! we are Christians,\" We made a covenant, but they forgot a part of that whereof they were admonished. Therefor We have stirred up enmity and hatred among them till the Day of Resurrection, when Allah will inform them of their handiwork.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"napraviti, izraditi","en":"to make"},"passage":["وَمِنَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","قَالُوٓا۟","إِنَّا","نَصَٰرَىٰٓ","أَخَذْنَا","مِيثَٰقَهُمْ","فَنَسُوا۟","حَظًّا","مِّمَّا","ذُكِّرُوا۟","بِهِۦ","فَأَغْرَيْنَا","بَيْنَهُمُ","ٱلْعَدَاوَةَ","وَٱلْبَغْضَآءَ","إِلَىٰ","يَوْمِ","ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","وَسَوْفَ","يُنَبِّئُهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","بِمَا","كَانُوا۟","يَصْنَعُونَ"],"marked":[24],"facts":{"verb":"صَنَعَ"}},{"id":"sanaa-11-16-10","words":["verb:sanaa"],"options":[{"bs":"napravili su","en":"they made"},{"bs":"i napravi","en":"and build"},{"bs":"pravi","en":"he/it makes"},{"bs":"prave","en":"they make"}],"ref":"11:16","answerWord":"صَنَعُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/313552d5173e89ab72a2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those are they for whom is naught in the Hereafter save the Fire. (All) that they contrive here is vain and (all) that they are wont to do is fruitless.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"napraviti, izraditi","en":"to make"},"passage":["أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","لَيْسَ","لَهُمْ","فِى","ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ","إِلَّا","ٱلنَّارُ","وَحَبِطَ","مَا","صَنَعُوا۟","فِيهَا","وَبَٰطِلٌ","مَّا","كَانُوا۟","يَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"صَنَعَ"}},{"id":"sanaa-7-137-23","words":["verb:sanaa"],"options":[{"bs":"pravi","en":"he/it makes"},{"bs":"i napravi","en":"and build"},{"bs":"prave","en":"they make"},{"bs":"napravili su","en":"they made"}],"ref":"7:137","answerWord":"يَصْنَعُ","answerSound":"audio/6b97c6c85039570b8b41.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We caused the folk who were despised to inherit the eastern parts of the land and the western parts thereof which We had blessed. And the fair word of thy Lord was fulfilled for the Children of Israel because of their endurance; and We annihilated (all) that Pharaoh and his folk had done and that they had contrived.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"napraviti, izraditi","en":"to make"},"passage":["وَأَوْرَثْنَا","ٱلْقَوْمَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَانُوا۟","يُسْتَضْعَفُونَ","مَشَٰرِقَ","ٱلْأَرْضِ","وَمَغَٰرِبَهَا","ٱلَّتِى","بَٰرَكْنَا","فِيهَا","وَتَمَّتْ","كَلِمَتُ","رَبِّكَ","ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ","عَلَىٰ","بَنِىٓ","إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","بِمَا","صَبَرُوا۟","وَدَمَّرْنَا","مَا","كَانَ","يَصْنَعُ","فِرْعَوْنُ","وَقَوْمُهُۥ","وَمَا","كَانُوا۟","يَعْرِشُونَ"],"marked":[23],"facts":{"verb":"صَنَعَ"}},{"id":"sanaa-11-37-0","words":["verb:sanaa"],"options":[{"bs":"i napravi","en":"and build"},{"bs":"pravite","en":"you (all) make"},{"bs":"i pravi","en":"and he/it makes"},{"bs":"prave","en":"they make"}],"ref":"11:37","answerWord":"وَٱصْنَعِ","answerSound":"audio/a7c1b0a2922e92c5029c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Build the ship under Our eyes and by Our inspiration, and speak not unto Me on behalf of those who do wrong. Lo! they will be drowned.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"napraviti, izraditi","en":"to make"},"passage":["وَٱصْنَعِ","ٱلْفُلْكَ","بِأَعْيُنِنَا","وَوَحْيِنَا","وَلَا","تُخَٰطِبْنِى","فِى","ٱلَّذِينَ","ظَلَمُوٓا۟","إِنَّهُم","مُّغْرَقُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"صَنَعَ"}},{"id":"sanaa-11-38-0","words":["verb:sanaa"],"options":[{"bs":"i pravi","en":"and he/it makes"},{"bs":"napravi!","en":"make!"},{"bs":"napravili su","en":"they made"},{"bs":"pravite","en":"you (all) make"}],"ref":"11:38","answerWord":"وَيَصْنَعُ","answerSound":"audio/7c73bf8ea34429eb659c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And he was building the ship, and every time that chieftains of his people passed him, they made mock of him. He said: Though ye make mock of Us, yet We mock at you even as ye mock;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"napraviti, izraditi","en":"to make"},"passage":["وَيَصْنَعُ","ٱلْفُلْكَ","وَكُلَّمَا","مَرَّ","عَلَيْهِ","مَلَأٌ","مِّن","قَوْمِهِۦ","سَخِرُوا۟","مِنْهُ","قَالَ","إِن","تَسْخَرُوا۟","مِنَّا","فَإِنَّا","نَسْخَرُ","مِنكُمْ","كَمَا","تَسْخَرُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"صَنَعَ"}},{"id":"sanaa-20-69-6","words":["verb:sanaa"],"options":[{"bs":"napravili su","en":"they made"},{"bs":"prave","en":"they make"},{"bs":"i napravi","en":"and build"},{"bs":"i pravi","en":"and he/it makes"}],"ref":"20:69","answerWord":"صَنَعُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/b9cf1458a0e065a64c17.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Throw that which is in thy right hand! It will eat up that which they have made. Lo! that which they have made is but a wizard's artifice, and a wizard shall not be successful to whatever point (of skill) he may attain.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"napraviti, izraditi","en":"to make"},"passage":["وَأَلْقِ","مَا","فِى","يَمِينِكَ","تَلْقَفْ","مَا","صَنَعُوٓا۟","إِنَّمَا","صَنَعُوا۟","كَيْدُ","سَٰحِرٍ","وَلَا","يُفْلِحُ","ٱلسَّاحِرُ","حَيْثُ","أَتَىٰ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"صَنَعَ"}},{"id":"sanaa-29-45-20","words":["verb:sanaa"],"options":[{"bs":"pravite","en":"you (all) make"},{"bs":"napravili su","en":"they made"},{"bs":"napravi!","en":"make!"},{"bs":"prave","en":"they make"}],"ref":"29:45","answerWord":"تَصْنَعُونَ","answerSound":"audio/17863bde7fb0e1edffe8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Recite that which hath been inspired in thee of the Scripture, and establish worship. Lo! worship preserveth from lewdness and iniquity, but verily remembrance of Allah is more important. And Allah knoweth what ye do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"napraviti, izraditi","en":"to make"},"passage":["ٱتْلُ","مَآ","أُوحِىَ","إِلَيْكَ","مِنَ","ٱلْكِتَٰبِ","وَأَقِمِ","ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","إِنَّ","ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","تَنْهَىٰ","عَنِ","ٱلْفَحْشَآءِ","وَٱلْمُنكَرِ","وَلَذِكْرُ","ٱللَّهِ","أَكْبَرُ","وَٱللَّهُ","يَعْلَمُ","مَا","تَصْنَعُونَ"],"marked":[20],"facts":{"verb":"صَنَعَ"}}]